  <steps mode="directional">
    <step order="1">git grep the full reference list; delete the resolver, endpoint, registration, unregistered L2 probe and tests.</step>
    <step order="2">Remove StagingContainerId (option + reads); update the ArchTest lists and the FR-31 / MUST / §4D wording.</step>
