  <acceptance-criteria>
    <criterion testable="true">`git grep -n "ITenantContainerResolver\|tenant-container-resolver\|StagingContainerId\|SpeContainerResolverInvariantProbe" -- src tests` returns nothing (docs/history excepted).</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">FR-31, the project CLAUDE.md MUST row and design §4D I4 name SpeContainerOwnershipGuard as the single definition of the stamp's containers.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">BFF tests, ControlPlane.Tests and ArchTests pass; ADR010 ceiling lowered by exactly the removed interface.</criterion>
